      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BENTLEY KRISTOFF (1) has a strong record here with five wins and a minor from nine starts. Was out of placings last time (25.57) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 4.5 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. GRACE ILE (6) is better than last start when fifth (22.45) in a Grade 5 at this track over 390m. Strike rate this course strong having won seven of 11 tries. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. One of the main contenders. SIX GINS (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Craven (21.92) in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Leading player again. GOLDEN SPARKLES (4) found the frame here last start and looks a top-three hope again.",
